==Battleground==
*The enemy base here is a [[Jar Base (Enemy Base)|Jar Base]].
*Infinite [[Zoge]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 30~40 seconds<sup>900f~1,200f</sup>.
*2 [[Zomboe]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*2 [[Zory|Zories]] spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
*2 [[Zir Zeal]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Zang Roo]] spawns after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>.
*1 [[THE SLOTH]] spawns as the boss after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The Zombies here are at EOC3 magnifications (50%) and shouldn't pose too much of an issue on their own if players are lucky enough to obtain a few anti-Zombie specialists to handle them. THE SLOTH is usually the bigger threat and will wall units for quite a while, so bring disposable attackers to chip him down once the Zombies are out of the way.

